  "f1MergeMessage": {
    "required": "Hard invariant 11: each remaining duplicate rule copy is named, with its reason, in the commit message (review F1).",
    "block": "Named duplicate rule copies (invariant 11), kept because LSC-2C owns only src/lib/campaign:\n- localSeatCredentialStore.ts password max 512 mirrors src/lib/api/securitySchemas.ts PASSWORD_MAX_LENGTH (unexported).\n- displayName max 64 mirrors securitySchemas.ts DISPLAY_NAME_MAX_LENGTH (unexported).\n- token lifetime caps 6h primary / 1h seat mirror auth/token.ts MAX_TTL_MS and LocalSeatCredentialService LOCAL_SEAT_POLICY.maxTtlMs (server-only; not importable into the browser).\n- 10s issuedAt drift, expiry and issued<expires checks mirror verifyPlayerToken/CLOCK_DRIFT_MS in src/lib/multiplayer/server/auth.ts (client pre-check; the server remains authoritative).\n- mintCoopCredential('primary') is a third client caller of POST /api/multiplayer/auth/token beside CampaignCoopEntryPanel.mintToken and multiplayerPage.helpers.mintToken.\nRouted at closure as CF-LSC2C-2: LSC-2 adopts mintCoopCredential in CampaignCoopEntryPanel and deletes its mintToken; a separately registered follow-up exports the schema constants and a pure token time-sanity helper from their owners.",
